searchParams.description:
Search parameters for matter discovery. All fields are optional.
    Matching rules: name, owner, anywhere, description, and subclass perform case-insensitive substring matches; custom1-12, custom17-20, and custom29-30 require exact (no wildcard/partial) matches;
    custom13-16 support wildcards (*) and partials; custom21-24 use date ranges via <field>_from and <field>_to in ISO 8601 (e.g., 2025-11-03T07:30:22.559Z); and custom25-28 are booleans.
